{"seq":3,"slug":"ci-cd-for-oss","title":"开源项目的 CI/CD","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/ci-cd-for-oss","wordCount":839,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"开源项目的-ci-cd\">开源项目的 CI/CD</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>CI/CD 是开源项目质量保障的自动化骨架：每次提交和 PR 都经过同一套检查，让代码库始终处于可发布状态。它的核心概念包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续集成（CI）</td>\n<td>每次提交自动运行测试、lint、构建等检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续交付（CD）</td>\n<td>通过流水线自动发布版本与产物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Workflow / Job</td>\n<td>GitHub Actions 的执行单元，由事件触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵测试</td>\n<td>在多操作系统、多运行时版本上并行验证兼容性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链安全</td>\n<td>通过扫描和依赖更新降低第三方依赖风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 预览</td>\n<td>为 PR 自动构建预览并回评，提升审查效率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"持续集成的价值\">持续集成的价值</h2><p>持续集成（Continuous Integration, CI）是开源项目质量保障的基石。每一次提交和 PR 都经过自动化检查，确保代码库始终处于可发布状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PUSH[代码提交] --&gt; CI[CI 流水线]&#10;    CI --&gt; TEST[自动化测试]&#10;    CI --&gt; LINT[代码规范检查]&#10;    CI --&gt; BUILD[构建验证]&#10;    CI --&gt; SECURITY[安全扫描]&#10;    TEST --&gt; RESULT{全部通过?}&#10;    LINT --&gt; RESULT&#10;    BUILD --&gt; RESULT&#10;    SECURITY --&gt; RESULT&#10;    RESULT --&gt;|是| MERGE[允许合并]&#10;    RESULT --&gt;|否| BLOCK[阻止合并]\">graph LR\n    PUSH[代码提交] --&gt; CI[CI 流水线]\n    CI --&gt; TEST[自动化测试]\n    CI --&gt; LINT[代码规范检查]\n    CI --&gt; BUILD[构建验证]\n    CI --&gt; SECURITY[安全扫描]\n    TEST --&gt; RESULT{全部通过?}\n    LINT --&gt; RESULT\n    BUILD --&gt; RESULT\n    SECURITY --&gt; RESULT\n    RESULT --&gt;|是| MERGE[允许合并]\n    RESULT --&gt;|否| BLOCK[阻止合并]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CI 检查项</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n<th>工具示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>验证功能正确性</td>\n<td>Vitest, Jest, pytest</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试</td>\n<td>验证模块间协作</td>\n<td>Playwright, Cypress</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码规范</td>\n<td>保持代码风格一致</td>\n<td>ESLint, Prettier</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>静态类型安全</td>\n<td>TypeScript, mypy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建验证</td>\n<td>确保产物可正常生成</td>\n<td>tsc, esbuild, rollup</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全扫描</td>\n<td>检测已知漏洞</td>\n<td>Dependabot, Snyk</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖率报告</td>\n<td>跟踪测试覆盖范围</td>\n<td>Codecov, Coveralls</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> CI 流水线的执行速度直接影响贡献者体验。将快速检查（lint、type check）放在前面，耗时操作（集成测试）放在后面，并善用缓存和并行执行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-基础\">GitHub Actions 基础</h2><p>GitHub Actions 是开源项目最常用的 CI/CD 平台，对公开仓库完全免费。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: CI&#10;&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;permissions:&#10;  contents: read&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  lint:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm lint&#10;      - run: pnpm typecheck&#10;&#10;  test:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    strategy:&#10;      matrix:&#10;        node-version: [18, 20, 22]&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ matrix.node-version }}&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm test -- --coverage&#10;      - uses: codecov/codecov-action@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          token: ${{ secrets.CODECOV_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">permissions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  contents</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">read</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  lint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm lint</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm typecheck</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    strategy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matrix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ matrix.node-version }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm test -- --coverage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">codecov/codecov-action@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          token</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.CODECOV_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    EVENT[Push / PR 事件] --&gt; WORKFLOW[Workflow 触发]&#10;    WORKFLOW --&gt; JOB1[lint Job]&#10;    WORKFLOW --&gt; JOB2[test Job]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; STEP1[Checkout]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; STEP2[Setup Node]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; STEP3[Install]&#10;    JOB1 --&gt; STEP4[Lint &amp; Typecheck]&#10;    JOB2 --&gt; MATRIX[矩阵策略]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; NODE18[Node 18]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; NODE20[Node 20]&#10;    MATRIX --&gt; NODE22[Node 22]\">graph TD\n    EVENT[Push / PR 事件] --&gt; WORKFLOW[Workflow 触发]\n    WORKFLOW --&gt; JOB1[lint Job]\n    WORKFLOW --&gt; JOB2[test Job]\n    JOB1 --&gt; STEP1[Checkout]\n    JOB1 --&gt; STEP2[Setup Node]\n    JOB1 --&gt; STEP3[Install]\n    JOB1 --&gt; STEP4[Lint &amp; Typecheck]\n    JOB2 --&gt; MATRIX[矩阵策略]\n    MATRIX --&gt; NODE18[Node 18]\n    MATRIX --&gt; NODE20[Node 20]\n    MATRIX --&gt; NODE22[Node 22]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多平台与矩阵测试\">多平台与矩阵测试</h2><p>开源库通常需要在多个操作系统和运行时版本上测试兼容性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"jobs:&#10;  test:&#10;    strategy:&#10;      fail-fast: false&#10;      matrix:&#10;        os: [ubuntu-latest, macos-latest, windows-latest]&#10;        node: [18, 20, 22]&#10;        exclude:&#10;          - os: windows-latest&#10;            node: 18&#10;    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: ${{ matrix.node }}&#10;      - run: npm ci&#10;      - run: npm test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=