i-dark:#85E89D\">      pull-requests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">write</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">npm ci &#x26;&#x26; npm run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">preview</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dist/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">marocchino/sticky-pull-request-comment@v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            📦 构建成功！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            - 包大小：`$(du -sh dist | cut -f1)`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            - 文件数：`$(find dist -type f | wc -l)`</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant D as 开发者&#10;    participant GH as GitHub&#10;    participant CI as CI 流水线&#10;    participant R as Reviewer&#10;&#10;    D-&gt;&gt;GH: 创建 PR&#10;    GH-&gt;&gt;CI: 触发 Workflow&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 构建 &amp; 测试&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;GH: 报告结果&#10;    CI-&gt;&gt;GH: 发布预览评论&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 查看 CI 结果&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 访问预览&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 完成 Review\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant D as 开发者\n    participant GH as GitHub\n    participant CI as CI 流水线\n    participant R as Reviewer\n\n    D-&gt;&gt;GH: 创建 PR\n    GH-&gt;&gt;CI: 触发 Workflow\n    CI-&gt;&gt;CI: 构建 &amp; 测试\n    CI-&gt;&gt;GH: 报告结果\n    CI-&gt;&gt;GH: 发布预览评论\n    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 查看 CI 结果\n    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 访问预览\n    R-&gt;&gt;GH: 完成 Review</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((CI/CD))&#10;    CI 检查&#10;      测试&#10;      Lint&#10;      类型检查&#10;      安全扫描&#10;    GitHub Actions&#10;      Workflow&#10;      矩阵测试&#10;      缓存策略&#10;    安全&#10;      Dependabot&#10;      npm audit&#10;      供应链安全&#10;    自动化&#10;      PR 预览&#10;      覆盖率报告&#10;      构建状态\">mindmap\n  root((CI/CD))\n    CI 检查\n      测试\n      Lint\n      类型检查\n      安全扫描\n    GitHub Actions\n      Workflow\n      矩阵测试\n      缓存策略\n    安全\n      Dependabot\n      npm audit\n      供应链安全\n    自动化\n      PR 预览\n      覆盖率报告\n      构建状态</pre><ul>\n<li>CI 是开源项目质量保障的基石，每次提交都应经过自动化验证。</li>\n<li>GitHub Actions 对公开仓库免费，通过矩阵策略可在多平台、多版本上并行测试。</li>\n<li>安全扫描和自动依赖更新（Dependabot/Renovate）是供应链安全的第一道防线。</li>\n<li>PR 预览和自动化反馈（构建大小、覆盖率变化）大幅提升 Code Review 效率。</li>\n<li>CI 流水线的速度直接影响贡献者体验，应优先执行快速检查并善用缓存。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开源项目的 CI/CD","id":"开源项目的-ci-cd"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"持续集成的价值","id":"持续集成的价值"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 基础","id":"github-actions-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"多平台与矩阵测试","id":"多平台与矩阵测试"},{"level":2,"text":"安全与依赖管理","id":"安全与依赖管理"},{"level":2,"text":"PR 预览与自动化","id":"pr-预览与自动化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文档策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/documentation-strategy"},"next":{"title":"版本发布管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/open-source-influence/building-projects/release-management"}}